{#
  avahi-discover (1) — a GUI mDNS/DNS-SD service browser
  ==============================================================================
  This package represents the Avahi Discover graphical utility.
  
  IMPORTANT: avahi-discover HAS NO CONFIGURATION FILE.
  It is a lightweight GUI client that consumes service discovery data provided
  by the Avahi daemon (avahi-daemon) and the local network.
  
  Configuration for service publishing, listening interfaces, or mDNS resolution
  belongs to:
    - avahi-daemon.conf (system daemon settings)
    - libnss-mdns (name resolution via /etc/nsswitch.conf)
    - Network interface configuration
  
  Therefore, no directives are rendered here. The presence of this template
  serves to document that this specific role/package requires no configuration
  generation and relies entirely on the running Avahi infrastructure.
#}